Netflix Content Exploratory Analysis
A comprehensive exploratory data analysis (EDA) of thousands of movies and TV shows, to understand content distribution by type, country, and release year.

Process
Dropped unnecessary columns and handled missing values.
Exploded the multi-value country column into a separate row per country.
Standardized the type column and converted the date column to a proper datetime format.
Classified content as "Recent / Old" based on release year (2018 as the cutoff).
Key Insights
Movies represent about 70% of total content compared to TV shows.
The United States leads content-producing countries, followed by India by a wide margin.
A sharp, noticeable growth in content added after 2018.
